# Reference clones, disposable. Pinned checkouts of the repositories this report
# makes claims ABOUT are cloned here and read BY PEOPLE. This is the mechanism
# the claims-verification pass runs against: every figure in report/draft.md is a
# claim about `visgraf/bio-3d-vision` or its predecessors, and "verifiable at
# source" means a checkout at the SHA pinned in docs/inherited-measurements.yaml.
#
# THE ENFORCEMENT THAT USED TO SIT BESIDE THIS IS GONE, and that is worth saying
# rather than leaving to be discovered. The template guarded this directory with
# a test asserting that no code reads from it. This repository has no code, so
# the guard had nothing to guard and was deleted with the rest of the suite. The
# convention survives on nobody's authority but this comment. If a figure script
# ever lands here, restore the guard with it -- see report/figures/README.md.
.reference/

# LaTeX build artifacts are ignored in report/.gitignore, beside the build that
# makes them.

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python. Nothing in this repository is Python -- there is no package, no test
# suite and no pyproject.toml. These stay because a one-off script written in
# report/figures/ would otherwise drop caches into the tree, and because the
# virtualenv left over from the template instantiation is still on disk.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
